    "wobble.group.move": "Move",
    "wobble.group.stabilise": "Stabilise",
    "wobble.how.goal.title": "The goal",
    "wobble.how.goal.text": "Two players face each other on a beam above the rooftop pool. Knock your opponent into the water without falling in yourself! Each fall gives the round to the other player.",
    "wobble.how.balance.title": "Your balance",
    "wobble.how.balance.text": "The needle on your dial shows your balance. It moves on its own, and faster and faster as you lean: hold Q to lean left and E to lean right, against the wobble. If the needle reaches the end of the red, splash!",
    "wobble.how.push.title": "Pushing",
    "wobble.how.push.text": "Right next to your opponent, A pushes them to the left and D to the right. Push them the way they're already leaning: that's where it hurts. A push into thin air throws you forward, and you wobble.",
    "wobble.how.move.title": "Moving",
    "wobble.how.move.text": "N and M make you step left or right along the beam. Each step makes you wobble a little. You can't walk through your opponent.",
    "wobble.how.stabilise.title": "Stabilising",
    "wobble.how.stabilise.text": "Space puts you back on balance: the needle returns to the middle. But only once per round: save it for the worst moment!",
    "wobble.how.sudden.title": "Sudden death",
    "wobble.how.sudden.text": "After 45 seconds, the beam starts shaking much harder: someone is going to end up in the water fast!",
    "wobble.waiting": "Waiting for an opponent... Another player can join you from the list of duels.",
    "wobble.ready": "Two fighters on the beam: ready?",
    "wobble.waiting_host": "The host starts the duel.",
