    "battleball.power.1.text": "The light bulb colours an area around you.",
    "battleball.power.2.text": "Bouncing with the spring locks tiles in a single bounce (10 seconds).",
    "battleball.power.3.text": "The flashlight colours a straight line in front of you.",
    "battleball.power.4.text": "A cannon shot locks the tiles in a straight line and knocks over anyone in the way.",
    "battleball.power.5.text": "Bouncing on a pin bursts your ball: scatter them in front of your opponents.",
    "battleball.power.6.text": "The harlequin makes everyone colour tiles for your team (10 seconds).",
    "battleball.power.7.text": "The bomb wipes the tiles around you and stuns everyone nearby, you included.",
    "battleball.power.8.text": "With the vacuum cleaner, every tile you bounce on turns grey again (10 seconds).",
    "battleball.power.9.text": "A surprise: one of the other power-ups.",
