    "fastfood.rules.how.drop.title": "Drop the plate",
    "fastfood.rules.how.drop": "When the plate is ready, press Space (or the big button): it falls. Before the start, it's a false start: the plate falls empty and you wait longer for the next one.",
    "fastfood.rules.how.chute.title": "Open the parachute",
    "fastfood.rules.how.chute": "Press again to open the parachute. The later you open it, the faster your plate is served; too late, and it hits the table too hard and the meal is ruined. The diners show you when it's getting close!",
    "fastfood.rules.how.powers.title": "Power-ups",
    "fastfood.rules.how.powers": "A plate served can earn you a power-up: press E (or the small button) to use it. The missile bursts the parachute of the player in the lead.",
    "fastfood.rules.how.goal": "Each plate served safely is a star. The first to fill their stars wins; after five minutes, whoever has the most.",
    "fastfood.power.1": "Missile",
    "fastfood.power.2": "Shield",
    "fastfood.power.3": "Big parachute",
    "fastfood.power.1.text": "Flies at the player in the lead: it bursts their plate's parachute, and the plate ends up in pieces unless it's very close to the table.",
    "fastfood.power.2.text": "Protects your plate from a missile, until it's served.",
    "fastfood.power.3.text": "Your next parachute brakes ten times harder: open it at the very last moment!",
