    "gamecenter.leaderboard.points": "A win is worth 10 points, a game played 2.",
    "gamecenter.uno.title": "UNO",
    "gamecenter.uno.description": "The card game everybody knows, at a table in the hotel. Same colour or same number, stack the +2s and +4s, jump in, catch a forgotten UNO... and be the first to empty your hand!",
    "gamecenter.werewolf.title": "Werewolf",
    "gamecenter.werewolf.description": "Night falls on the village: werewolves are hiding among you. Seer, Witch, Hunter, Cupid and twenty other roles. Talk, accuse, vote... and survive until morning. Up to 49 villagers around the fire!",
    "gamecenter.wobble.title": "Wobble Squabble",
    "gamecenter.wobble.description": "The 2004 original on the hotel roof: two Habbos on the buoys above the pool. Lean, push, dodge and keep your balance to send the other one into the water!",
    "gamecenter.wobblenext.title": "Wobble Squabble Next Gen",
    "gamecenter.wobblenext.description": "The beam duel in a brand new pool, surrounded by the hotel's furni, with a balance dial and big keys. Still a splash at the end, with a new look!",
    "gamecenter.battleball.title": "BattleBall: Rebound!",
    "gamecenter.fastfood.title": "Fast Food",
    "gamecenter.fastfood.description": "The diners are hungry! Drop the plates from the top of the restaurant and open the parachute at the very last moment. Missiles, shields and big parachutes to slow the others down.",
    "gamecenter.hall.title": "The game hall",
    "gamecenter.hall.description": "The sly Fox's game hall from 2004: tic-tac-toe (five in a row), four in a row, battleships, chess and poker with jokers. A table, a friend or a robot, and off you go!",
    "gamecenter.snails.title": "The snail race",
    "gamecenter.snails.description": "Six snails, six lanes, one garden. They crawl on their own, take naps or get a burst of energy: cheer yours on at the right moment to see it cross the line first!",
    "gamecenter.quiz.title": "The hotel quiz",
    "gamecenter.quiz.description": "Lights, camera, questions! Ten questions about the hotel and the world on the studio's big screen. The faster your right answer, the more points you score.",
    "gamecenter.tetris.title": "Blocks duel",
    "gamecenter.tetris.description": "Everyone at their own arcade machine, all playing at the same time. Clear two rows or more at once to bury the others under rubbish: the last one standing wins!",
    "gamecenter.diving.title": "The diving board",
    "gamecenter.diving.description": "Climb to the top of the Lido tower, run along the board, jump and pull off tricks before the splash. The others hold up their marks: the best total wins!",
    "gamecenter.kart.title": "HabboKart",
    "gamecenter.kart.description": "Pick your kart and race three laps: drifts, turbos, banana peels and shells! Up to eight drivers, online or against robots.",
    "gamecenter.copywriter.title": "Lost Monkey",
    "gamecenter.copywriter.description": "Habbo's monkey is lost on a desert island! Take care of him, walk him around the island, give him bananas and play the island's games with him.",
