    "gamecenter.uno.howto.1": "Play a card of the same colour or the same number as the one on top of the pile.",
    "gamecenter.uno.howto.2": "No card to play? Draw. +2s and +4s make the next player draw, Skip and Reverse change the turn.",
    "gamecenter.uno.howto.3": "A Wild card lets you choose the colour.",
    "gamecenter.uno.howto.4": "Down to one card: press UNO! before someone catches you.",
    "gamecenter.uno.howto.5": "The first one out of cards wins.",
    "gamecenter.werewolf.howto.1": "Everyone gets a secret role: villagers, werewolves, and a few loners.",
    "gamecenter.werewolf.howto.2": "At night, the werewolves choose a victim, and the roles with a power use it.",
    "gamecenter.werewolf.howto.3": "By day, the village talks and votes to eliminate a suspect.",
    "gamecenter.werewolf.howto.4": "The village wins when all the wolves are dead, the wolves when they are as many as the villagers.",
    "gamecenter.werewolf.howto.5": "When it's your turn to act, click a player's name to choose them.",
    "gamecenter.wobble.howto.1": "Two players face to face on the buoys above the pool.",
    "gamecenter.wobble.howto.2": "Hold Q or E to lean left or right and keep your balance.",
    "gamecenter.wobble.howto.3": "A and D push the other player, N and M move you along the buoys.",
    "gamecenter.wobble.howto.4": "Space puts you back on balance, once per round.",
    "gamecenter.wobble.howto.5": "Whoever falls into the water loses the round.",
    "gamecenter.wobblenext.howto.1": "Two players face to face on the buoys above the pool.",
    "gamecenter.wobblenext.howto.2": "Hold Q or E to lean: watch the dial and keep the needle in the middle.",
    "gamecenter.wobblenext.howto.3": "A and D push the other player, N and M move you along the buoys.",
    "gamecenter.wobblenext.howto.4": "Space puts you back on balance, once per round.",
    "gamecenter.wobblenext.howto.5": "Whoever falls into the water loses the round.",
    "gamecenter.battleball.howto.1": "Click a tile to bounce there: every tile you land on takes your team's colour.",
    "gamecenter.battleball.howto.2": "Land on it again to make it lighter, up to 14 points per tile.",
    "gamecenter.battleball.howto.3": "Close off an area with your colour to fill it in one go.",
    "gamecenter.battleball.howto.4": "Pick up power-ups and use them with Space.",
    "gamecenter.battleball.howto.5": "The team with the most points at the end wins.",
    "gamecenter.fastfood.howto.1": "Press Space to drop your plate from the kitchen.",
    "gamecenter.fastfood.howto.2": "Press Space again to open the parachute: too late, or too early, and the plate breaks!",
    "gamecenter.fastfood.howto.3": "Each plate served gives you a star.",
    "gamecenter.fastfood.howto.4": "A plate served can give you a power-up: use it with E (missile, shield, big parachute).",
    "gamecenter.fastfood.howto.5": "The first to serve all the plates wins.",
    "gamecenter.hall.howto.1": "The five games of the old game hall: tic-tac-toe (five in a row), four in a row, battleships, chess and poker.",
    "gamecenter.hall.howto.2": "Choose a game, then sit at a table or open one.",
    "gamecenter.hall.howto.3": "Take turns: you have 60 seconds per move.",
    "gamecenter.hall.howto.4": "Nobody around? Add robots.",
    "gamecenter.snails.howto.1": "Up to six snails race in their own lane.",
    "gamecenter.snails.howto.2": "Press Space to cheer your snail on: it goes faster.",
    "gamecenter.snails.howto.3": "Too much cheering tires it out: find the right rhythm!",
    "gamecenter.snails.howto.4": "The first snail across the line wins.",
    "gamecenter.quiz.howto.1": "Ten questions about Habbo and the hotel, four answers each time.",
    "gamecenter.quiz.howto.2": "Click A, B, C or D before time runs out.",
    "gamecenter.quiz.howto.3": "A right answer is worth 500 points, plus a speed bonus.",
    "gamecenter.quiz.howto.4": "The best score after ten questions wins.",
    "gamecenter.tetris.howto.1": "The arrows move and turn the pieces, down makes them fall faster, Space drops them at once.",
    "gamecenter.tetris.howto.2": "Fill a whole row to clear it.",
    "gamecenter.tetris.howto.3": "Clear 2, 3 or 4 rows at once to send rows of rubbish to the others.",
    "gamecenter.tetris.howto.4": "The last one standing wins, otherwise the best score after 4 minutes.",
    "gamecenter.diving.howto.1": "Everyone takes turns diving from the top of the diving board.",
    "gamecenter.diving.howto.2": "Run with A and D, jump with Space.",
    "gamecenter.diving.howto.3": "In the air, pull off tricks with the W, E, A, S, D, X and Z keys.",
    "gamecenter.diving.howto.4": "The others mark your dive from 0 to 10.",
    "gamecenter.diving.howto.5": "The best total of marks wins.",
    "gamecenter.kart.howto.1": "Pick your kart, then race online or against robots.",
    "gamecenter.kart.howto.2": "The arrows: the direction to go on the screen. The kart turns and drives on its own.",
    "gamecenter.kart.howto.3": "Hold Shift in the bends to drift, then let go for a turbo.",
    "gamecenter.kart.howto.4": "Drive through the \"?\" boxes and use your item with Space: turbo, banana peel, shell.",
    "gamecenter.kart.howto.5": "Three laps: the first across the line wins!",
    "gamecenter.copywriter.howto.1": "Your monkey lives on his island: feed him, wash him, let him sleep and keep him entertained.",
    "gamecenter.copywriter.howto.2": "Pick bananas from the banana trees and use the things on the island.",
    "gamecenter.copywriter.howto.3": "Play Jungle Jam and Banana Drama to earn coins.",
    "gamecenter.copywriter.howto.4": "Build the rocket part by part, then launch it!",
    "gamecenter.copywriter.howto.5": "At the typewriter, Copy Writer: type back the parrot's letters, the last monkey awake wins.",
